{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>香港小姐2026｜《2026香港小姐競選》日前圓滿落幕，新科港姐冠軍袁絲珩（Bernice）在社交平台發表感性長文。除了向大會、評判、觀眾以及台前幕後團隊致謝外，她更坦言獲獎一刻心情依然震撼。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-118\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-118\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>袁絲珩在帖文中開場寫道：「大家好，我係香港小姐競選2026冠軍 袁絲珩Bernice！👑💕」她坦言，歷經兩個月的歷練後走到這一步，感覺依然「好似發咗一場夢💭」。她首先感激評判與大會的賞識，以及每一位支持香港小姐的觀眾，並表示這幾日收到源源不絕的讚賞與鼓勵，讓她深感感恩。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-118\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4d534faf-7309-4ed8-a46b-39d43dc9d05c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269yoavxQv8j1788426484.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4d534faf-7309-4ed8-a46b-39d43dc9d05c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-118\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-119\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>談到頒獎時的真實心情，袁絲珩直言當時難掩緊張：「坦白講，到宣佈個一刻，我雙手都仲係震緊，個腦一片空白。」她感性指出，頭上的后冠意義深遠且沉重：「呢個后冠好重，因為佢承載嘅唔止係我一個人嘅努力，而係台下每一位工作人員嘅心血、佳麗們嘅努力，同埋永遠喺背後默默支持我嘅屋企人同朋友，多謝你哋，呢個榮譽都係屬於你哋嘅👑🩷」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-119\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-119\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f9076b8e-8171-4eec-aedf-40bd19f1f274.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202697fQsVUDyy1788426482.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f9076b8e-8171-4eec-aedf-40bd19f1f274.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-120\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-120\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>除了表達感激之情，袁絲珩亦大方吐露過往的自卑心情。她坦言自己曾經與很多女生一樣，覺得自己不夠厲害、不夠漂亮，甚至一度懷疑過自己是否適合繼續做表演。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-120\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e6e105ec-b834-4e2f-a815-eea5f23f0ef7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Z4IeRLiAIx1788426483.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e6e105ec-b834-4e2f-a815-eea5f23f0ef7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-120\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e00b75e67e77f233-121\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>然而，「香港小姐」這四個字重新定義了她心中的美：「美麗從來唔應該被定義。只要你相信自己，堅持善良，唔好放棄，平凡嘅女仔都可以有追夢嘅勇氣🔥✨」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T09:21:07.329598+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":536,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}